                        </p>

                        <h3>
                            Philosophy & The Mind
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Identity, consciousness, discipline, meaning, truth,
                            human behavior, attention, entertainment, purpose,
                            ambition, enough, freedom, belief, and the questions
                            that continue shaping how I understand the world.
                        </p>

                        <div class="tributary-tags">

                            <span>Philosophy</span>
                            <span>Meaning</span>
                            <span>Identity</span>
