                        </p>

                        <h3>
                            Ministry & Community Service
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Feeding people, supporting families, caring for those
                            overlooked by institutions, responding to local needs,
                            creating dignified forms of help, building community,
                            and using future resources to serve something beyond
                            personal comfort.
                        </p>

                        <div class="tributary-tags">

                            <span>Service</span>
                            <span>Community</span>
                            <span>Food</span>
