        </section>


        <section class="tributaries-final">

            <div class="reading-shell">

                <p class="section-label">
                    One river
                </p>

                <h2>
                    The subjects are different. The life carrying them is the same.
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Everything gathered here eventually returns to one question:
                </p>

                <blockquote class="tributaries-final-quote">
                    How do I become capable of receiving a life, caring for it well,
                    and allowing what I have been given to flow toward others?
                </blockquote>

                <p>
                    That is the work beneath every tributary.
                </p>

                <div class="page-actions">

                    <a href="/current/" class="button page-button-primary">
                        Enter the Current
                    </a>

                    <a href="/river-guides/" class="button page-button-secondary">
